      {
        "title": "Depremde Ses Var (Voice in the Earthquake)",
        "start_date": "Feb 2023",
        "description": "After the devastating earthquakes in my country Turkey, I took the initiative to create a website that displays tweets from Twitter which includes an address inside from the hashtag #sesvar(translates to there is a voice). This project is important because after the disaster everybody started sharing addresses of people that are under the apartment wrecks but the shared information was chaotic and it was not feasible to find any address and send a rescue team in that state of chaos. My website serves as a place in which people can find addresses together formatted in a readable style. I have reached over 20,000 people now."
      }
